title: "Hyperparameter Tuning of a Fully Connected Network on CIFAR-10"
abstract: "A controlled study of batch size, batch normalization, random search and Bayesian optimization (TPE) under an equal eight-trial budget, with noise-band decision rules, one-standard-error model selection and a single held-out test evaluation."
